---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects & Data
permalink: /projects/
---
<h1 class="page-title">Projects &amp; Data</h1>
<p class="lead">Large-scale efforts to measure how organizations are managed, and to test what works in the field.</p>

<section class="howwework">
  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>{{ site.how_we_work }}</p>
</section>

<div class="cards">
  {% for pr in site.projects %}
  <article class="card">
    <div class="smallcaps red">{{ pr.label }}</div>
    <h2>{{ pr.name }}</h2>
    <p>{{ pr.text }}</p>
    <a class="more" href="{{ pr.url }}">{{ pr.linktext }}</a>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>Research support</h2></div>
  <p class="section-blurb">This work has been supported by:</p>
  <ul class="funders">{% for f in site.funders %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
</section>
